      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "MIC",
          "chapter": 3,
          "verse": 10
        }
      ],
      "en": "who build up Zion with blood, and Jerusalem with iniquity.",
      "ko": "시온을 피로, 예루살렘을 죄악으로 건축하는도다",
      "source_text_hash": "8591f73800fc74480fe86038afe93334c1d0180880283e08d35ae463975d9638",
      "translation_text_hash": "2a77e2fc098d1030b95d966d855f00d00f697b937ecf3013d6dac68c3765151d",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "시온을 피로, 예루살렘을 죄악으로 건축하는도다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "2a77e2fc098d1030b95d966d855f00d00f697b937ecf3013d6dac68c3765151d"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:MIC:3:11",
